3:["$","p","As her reputation grew stronger, her business followed suit. She enlisted the support of her brother Billy Bonamici to help manage the overwhelming growth.",{"children":"As her reputation grew stronger, her business followed suit. She enlisted the support of her brother Billy Bonamici to help manage the overwhelming growth."}]
4:["$","p","To supply the demand, they purchased a shrimp dock and purchasing plant in Hackberry, Louisiana.",{"children":"To supply the demand, they purchased a shrimp dock and purchasing plant in Hackberry, Louisiana."}]
5:["$","p","Napoleonic Law and restrictions plagued the growing business, eventually landing her before the Supreme Court. To the delight of the community, she emerged victorious.",{"children":"Napoleonic Law and restrictions plagued the growing business, eventually landing her before the Supreme Court. To the delight of the community, she emerged victorious."}]
6:["$","section","Building Steamboat Bill's",{"className":"story-section story-section-alt","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"story-section-inner","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"story-section-content","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"section-eyebrow","children":"Kathi & Bill"}],["$","h2",null,{"children":"Building Steamboat Bill's"}],[["$","p","Years later, William \"Bill\" Vidrine, a local fisherman, joined Kathi in her journey.",{"children":"Years later, William \"Bill\" Vidrine, a local fisherman, joined Kathi in her journey."}],["$","p","Being a leader in the seafood industry, Bill used his experience and knowledge of the business to accelerate the growth of Steamboat Bill's Seafood Market.",{"children":"Being a leader in the seafood industry, Bill used his experience and knowledge of the business to accelerate the growth of Steamboat Bill's Seafood Market."}],["$","p","Later, they opened two Steamboat Bill's locations in Lake Charles, Louisiana — on Lakeshore Drive and Martin Luther King Hwy.",{"children":"Later, they opened two Steamboat Bill's locations in Lake Charles, Louisiana — on Lakeshore Drive and Martin Luther King Hwy."}]]]}]}]}]
7:["$","section","A Roadside Dream That Became A Tradition",{"className":"story-section ","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"story-section-inner","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"story-section-content","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"section-eyebrow","children":"The Legacy"}],["$","h2",null,{"children":"A Roadside Dream That Became A Tradition"}],[["$","p","Sticking to a firm business model, working long hours, and focusing on delivering a quality product, Kathi and Bill were unknowingly creating a brand that has withstood the test of time.",{"children":"Sticking to a firm business model, working long hours, and focusing on delivering a quality product, Kathi and Bill were unknowingly creating a brand that has withstood the test of time."}],["$","p","The success of Steamboat Bill's is credited to God, our loyal customers, our hard-working staff, the founding family, and most importantly the roadside peddler's dream of Kathi Bonamici Vidrine.",{"children":"The success of Steamboat Bill's is credited to God, our loyal customers, our hard-working staff, the founding family, and most importantly the roadside peddler's dream of Kathi Bonamici Vidrine."}],["$","p","With the support of everyone involved in the journey, Steamboat Bill's has gained the reputation that it maintains in the restaurant industry.",{"children":"With the support of everyone involved in the journey, Steamboat Bill's has gained the reputation that it maintains in the restaurant industry."}],["$","p","With multiple locations emerging throughout the South, the growth of the franchise is being realized. The excitement is overwhelming and the possibilities are endless.",{"children":"With multiple locations emerging throughout the South, the growth of the franchise is being realized. The excitement is overwhelming and the possibilities are endless."}]]]}]}]}]
